<p>The estimated <b>Price-to-Earnings (P/E) Ratio</b> for <b>S&P 500 Index</b> is <b>24.07</b>, calculated on <b>27 October 2026</b>.</p>

<p>Considering the last 5 years, an average P/E interval is [20.33 , 26.94].
  For this reason, the current P/E can be considered <font class="w3-padding-small bd-gray-300 ">Fair</font>
</p>

  <p>P/E Ratio is calculated on the <b>SPY</b> Etf, whose benchmark is the S&P 500 Index.</p>

